[{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b003:l039","ordinal":165633,"en":"\"What can be done?\" they asked,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b004:l001","ordinal":165634,"en":"And the Muslims were distressed."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b004:l002","ordinal":165635,"en":"They gathered together"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b004:l003","ordinal":165636,"en":"And could find no solution."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b004:l004","ordinal":165637,"en":"Poor prophetic Kanykey"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b004:l005","ordinal":165638,"en":"Walked with measured steps"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b004:l006","ordinal":165639,"en":"Into the midst of all those people."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b004:l007","ordinal":165640,"en":"Your poor prophetic kinswoman"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b004:l008","ordinal":165641,"en":"Sat down then"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b004:l009","ordinal":165642,"en":"And began an ominous speech:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b004:l010","ordinal":165643,"en":"\"A person has many turns of fortune."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b004:l011","ordinal":165644,"en":"When I was fourteen, still a girl,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b004:l012","ordinal":165645,"en":"Destroyer Bakay was there too;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b004:l013","ordinal":165646,"en":"My gray-maned lord went to Bukhara"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b004:l014","ordinal":165647,"en":"And left a scar upon my breast."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b004:l015","ordinal":165648,"en":"Gray-maned heroes, you stand here;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b004:l016","ordinal":165649,"en":"I still have much to tell."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b004:l017","ordinal":165650,"en":"Yesterday, to the city of my father Temir Khan,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b004:l018","ordinal":165651,"en":"Loading gold coins on eighty camels,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b004:l019","ordinal":165652,"en":"Saying, 'I will bind her head in marriage,'"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b004:l020","ordinal":165653,"en":"My padishah lord went."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b004:l021","ordinal":165654,"en":"When he became an in-law, slaughtered livestock,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b004:l022","ordinal":165655,"en":"And made his obeisance,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b004:l023","ordinal":165656,"en":"My father Temir Khan"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b004:l024","ordinal":165657,"en":"Had the gold poured out"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b004:l025","ordinal":165658,"en":"And stored in the treasury."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b004:l026","ordinal":165659,"en":"When he gathered khojas and mullahs,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b004:l027","ordinal":165660,"en":"Made the marriage rite at high noon,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b004:l028","ordinal":165661,"en":"And eighty brides and eighty girls"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b004:l029","ordinal":165662,"en":"Spread bedding from the waist-high dais,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b004:l030","ordinal":165663,"en":"They brought me there with ceremony,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b004:l031","ordinal":165664,"en":"Intending to lay me down."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b004:l032","ordinal":165665,"en":"When I reached the drawn curtain"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b004:l033","ordinal":165666,"en":"And was about to lie down,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b004:l034","ordinal":165667,"en":"The white tinte bought"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b004:l035","ordinal":165668,"en":"For sixty foals and forty sheep"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b004:l036","ordinal":165669,"en":"Leapt from its sheath,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b004:l037","ordinal":165670,"en":"And grazed your wrist:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b004:l038","ordinal":165671,"en":"\"Before I have even taken this shrew,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1172:b004:l039","ordinal":165672,"en":"She has wounded my wrist,\" you said."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b003:l001","ordinal":165673,"en":"The people gathered,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b003:l002","ordinal":165674,"en":"Made a claim against my poor head,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b003:l003","ordinal":165675,"en":"And laid the penalty upon my neck,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b003:l004","ordinal":165676,"en":"O gray-maned leopard lord."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b003:l005","ordinal":165677,"en":"You left without lying in my embrace;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b003:l006","ordinal":165678,"en":"In the fortress at Bukhara,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b003:l007","ordinal":165679,"en":"Because of this hero,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b003:l008","ordinal":165680,"en":"I was left an unmarried woman in Altai."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b003:l009","ordinal":165681,"en":"\"Rather than be left unmarried as a maiden,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b003:l010","ordinal":165682,"en":"I will die from this sight;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b003:l011","ordinal":165683,"en":"I will see the face of Judgment Day,\" I said."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b003:l012","ordinal":165684,"en":"When Manas returned to Talas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b003:l013","ordinal":165685,"en":"My poor soul made a vow"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b003:l014","ordinal":165686,"en":"To catch him from behind,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b003:l015","ordinal":165687,"en":"To stalk the bloodletter"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b003:l016","ordinal":165688,"en":"And offer him as a sacrifice,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b003:l017","ordinal":165689,"en":"And thus take revenge"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b003:l018","ordinal":165690,"en":"For being left unmarried."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b003:l019","ordinal":165691,"en":"My poor hair, thick as sedge,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b003:l020","ordinal":165692,"en":"I tied tightly atop my head,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b003:l021","ordinal":165693,"en":"And put on a man's clothing."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b003:l022","ordinal":165694,"en":"A golden-cheeked battle-axe"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b003:l023","ordinal":165695,"en":"I fastened firmly to my arm;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b003:l024","ordinal":165696,"en":"The double-edged Zulpukor"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b003:l025","ordinal":165697,"en":"I strapped on loosely."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b003:l026","ordinal":165698,"en":"When I pursued"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b003:l027","ordinal":165699,"en":"Generous Lord Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b003:l028","ordinal":165700,"en":"Firing a gun and drawing a bow,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b003:l029","ordinal":165701,"en":"Thinking to stalk and slaughter him,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b003:l030","ordinal":165702,"en":"To put the broad-chested lord"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b003:l031","ordinal":165703,"en":"To death,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b003:l032","ordinal":165704,"en":"I advanced in terrible rage,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b003:l033","ordinal":165705,"en":"Saying I had been left unmarried as a girl—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b003:l034","ordinal":165706,"en":"A grievous wrong before all the world;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b003:l035","ordinal":165707,"en":"Among the Kyrgyz there is no such deed."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b003:l036","ordinal":165708,"en":"When I stalked the leopard,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b003:l037","ordinal":165709,"en":"He had camped"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b003:l038","ordinal":165710,"en":"On a spur of the accursed mountain,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b003:l039","ordinal":165711,"en":"Playing chatyrash and making merry;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b004:l001","ordinal":165712,"en":"So he was passing his time."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b004:l002","ordinal":165713,"en":"They were slaughtering"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b004:l003","ordinal":165714,"en":"Forty barren foals."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b004:l004","ordinal":165715,"en":"Without a care for worldly goods,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b004:l005","ordinal":165716,"en":"He was living in pleasure."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b004:l006","ordinal":165717,"en":"All forty companions"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b004:l007","ordinal":165718,"en":"Surrounded the hero"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b004:l008","ordinal":165719,"en":"In a circle."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b004:l009","ordinal":165720,"en":"The hero of the forty companions,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b004:l010","ordinal":165721,"en":"Saintly hero Bakay,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b004:l011","ordinal":165722,"en":"The valiant one among them all,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b004:l012","ordinal":165723,"en":"Had readied his bow, poor soul."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b004:l013","ordinal":165724,"en":"As I meant to shoot Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b004:l014","ordinal":165725,"en":"Grease issued from my fingers"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b004:l015","ordinal":165726,"en":"And blood from beneath my nails."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b004:l016","ordinal":165727,"en":"When I raised the bow to my face"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b004:l017","ordinal":165728,"en":"And drew near the valiant man,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b004:l018","ordinal":165729,"en":"Nine guardian spirits"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b004:l019","ordinal":165730,"en":"Stood at the armpit"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b004:l020","ordinal":165731,"en":"Of the hero favored by Khojos;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b004:l021","ordinal":165732,"en":"Forty chiltens supported him"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b004:l022","ordinal":165733,"en":"And fixed their precious gaze upon me."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b004:l023","ordinal":165734,"en":"All forty lions"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b004:l024","ordinal":165735,"en":"Had then surrounded"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b004:l025","ordinal":165736,"en":"The hero."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b004:l026","ordinal":165737,"en":"A black-striped leopard"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b004:l027","ordinal":165738,"en":"Strained at his side."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b004:l028","ordinal":165739,"en":"Unable to endure the sight,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b004:l029","ordinal":165740,"en":"When I saw his guardians,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b004:l030","ordinal":165741,"en":"I thought, \"Alas, lion and leopard,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b004:l031","ordinal":165742,"en":"Let him leave me unmarried if he wishes;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b004:l032","ordinal":165743,"en":"Let his heart make me a concubine if it wishes."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b004:l033","ordinal":165744,"en":"If he will not take me from Bukhara,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b004:l034","ordinal":165745,"en":"I will gather girls from forty households,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b004:l035","ordinal":165746,"en":"Go stay in a white yurt,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b004:l036","ordinal":165747,"en":"And ingratiate myself as his wife.\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b004:l037","ordinal":165748,"en":"I formed this plan,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b004:l038","ordinal":165749,"en":"Turned back my black-blazed courser,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1173:b004:l039","ordinal":165750,"en":"And galloped away,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b003:l001","ordinal":165751,"en":"Heading toward Bukhara."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b003:l002","ordinal":165752,"en":"At the nose of the accursed mountain,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b003:l003","ordinal":165753,"en":"At its looming promontory,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b003:l004","ordinal":165754,"en":"Just as I reached it,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b003:l005","ordinal":165755,"en":"When I turned my horse's head,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b003:l006","ordinal":165756,"en":"He was clearing the road,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b003:l007","ordinal":165757,"en":"Standing watch,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b003:l008","ordinal":165758,"en":"Mounted on a red chestnut horse,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b003:l009","ordinal":165759,"en":"Its hair tail tightly knotted,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b003:l010","ordinal":165760,"en":"Finding no mountain to assail,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b003:l011","ordinal":165761,"en":"Finding no enemy to fight,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b003:l012","ordinal":165762,"en":"Consumed by his own thoughts."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b003:l013","ordinal":165763,"en":"Like an eagle of Orolmo-Too,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b003:l014","ordinal":165764,"en":"Perched without a wrist-rest,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b003:l015","ordinal":165765,"en":"I saw hero Agysh"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b003:l016","ordinal":165766,"en":"Riding out toward me."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b003:l017","ordinal":165767,"en":"When I saw hero Agysh,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b003:l018","ordinal":165768,"en":"His whole body was sinew;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b003:l019","ordinal":165769,"en":"He was a man useful in need,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b003:l020","ordinal":165770,"en":"A lion kinsman of generous spirit."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b003:l021","ordinal":165771,"en":"Against a champion like Tukubay,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b003:l022","ordinal":165772,"en":"Agysh will serve, O people;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b003:l023","ordinal":165773,"en":"To wrestle and win vengeance,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b003:l024","ordinal":165774,"en":"Put elbow-sized Agysh,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b003:l025","ordinal":165775,"en":"O lion and leopard lord,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b003:l026","ordinal":165776,"en":"Into the wrestling match."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b003:l027","ordinal":165777,"en":"Peerless Agysh was a hero;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b003:l028","ordinal":165778,"en":"When infidel and Muslim"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b003:l029","ordinal":165779,"en":"Clashed together,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b003:l030","ordinal":165780,"en":"He was a man who won vengeance."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b003:l031","ordinal":165781,"en":"When I saw hero Agysh,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b003:l032","ordinal":165782,"en":"His strength was immense;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b003:l033","ordinal":165783,"en":"The valiant, highborn champion"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b003:l034","ordinal":165784,"en":"Was himself a mighty hero."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b003:l035","ordinal":165785,"en":"Fierce champion Tukubay"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b003:l036","ordinal":165786,"en":"Was a man fit for him to grapple."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b003:l037","ordinal":165787,"en":"To throw him and win vengeance,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b003:l038","ordinal":165788,"en":"My joyous leopard lord,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b003:l039","ordinal":165789,"en":"Agysh is the champion you have found.\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b004:l001","ordinal":165790,"en":"The wrathful leopard"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b004:l002","ordinal":165791,"en":"Heeded the queen's words."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b004:l003","ordinal":165792,"en":"Twelve companions and Kyrgylchal"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b004:l004","ordinal":165793,"en":"Received the hero's command"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b004:l005","ordinal":165794,"en":"And went to seek Agysh."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b004:l006","ordinal":165795,"en":"Though they searched mountain and hill,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b004:l007","ordinal":165796,"en":"Agysh could not be found there."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b004:l008","ordinal":165797,"en":"Though they searched the gathered people,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b004:l009","ordinal":165798,"en":"Agysh could not be found there."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b004:l010","ordinal":165799,"en":"He had had his tent adorned with gold."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b004:l011","ordinal":165800,"en":"When they migrated from Tashkent,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b004:l012","ordinal":165801,"en":"Saying, \"Let them provide adornment,\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b004:l013","ordinal":165802,"en":"Kokotoy's Bokmurun"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b004:l014","ordinal":165803,"en":"Summoned exactly sixty palace girls,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b004:l015","ordinal":165804,"en":"And had those girls brought."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b004:l016","ordinal":165805,"en":"At Khan Kokotoy's feast,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b004:l017","ordinal":165806,"en":"The palace girls were playing"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b004:l018","ordinal":165807,"en":"Along Jele-Karkyra."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b004:l019","ordinal":165808,"en":"Your unruly ruffian Agysh"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b004:l020","ordinal":165809,"en":"Had gone to the palace girls"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b004:l021","ordinal":165810,"en":"And was playing splendid games."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b004:l022","ordinal":165811,"en":"A great player, a girl's delight—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b004:l023","ordinal":165812,"en":"Such was your Agysh's way."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b004:l024","ordinal":165813,"en":"In a house with girls, he played the fiddle;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b004:l025","ordinal":165814,"en":"In a house with kumis, he served the cups."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b004:l026","ordinal":165815,"en":"With his red belt trailing—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b004:l027","ordinal":165816,"en":"Such was Agysh's way—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b004:l028","ordinal":165817,"en":"Whenever he saw a girl, he asked for her."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b004:l029","ordinal":165818,"en":"With his black belt trailing—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b004:l030","ordinal":165819,"en":"Such was Agysh's way—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b004:l031","ordinal":165820,"en":"Whenever he saw a woman, he asked for her."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b004:l032","ordinal":165821,"en":"When he saw a girl, he grew animated"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b004:l033","ordinal":165822,"en":"And began a splendid song;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b004:l034","ordinal":165823,"en":"When hero Agysh saw a woman,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b004:l035","ordinal":165824,"en":"He nearly died of longing."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1174:b004:l036","o